@host = http://localhost:5144

### 0) Get demo tokens (Development only) → copy "accessToken" values below
POST {{host}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user": "admin" }

###
POST {{host}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user": "ayse" }

###
@adminToken = paste-admin-token-here
@ayseToken = paste-ayse-token-here

### 1) Create a product (admin only) → copy "id" from the response into @productId
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Telefon X", "price": 10000, "currency": "TRY", "initialStock": 5 }

###
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 2) Read it back
GET {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### 3) Place an order → copy "id" into @orderId
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{ayseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2 } ] }

###
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 4) Read the order
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ayseToken}}

### 400 — empty basket
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{ayseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [] }

### 422 — more than in stock
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{ayseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 99 } ] }

### 401 — no token
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [] }

### 403 — signed in, but not an admin
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{ayseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Yetkisiz Urun", "price": 1, "currency": "TRY", "initialStock": 1 }

### Idempotency — send this twice: the second answer is the SAME order id, no second order
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{ayseToken}}
Idempotency-Key: checkout-demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### 422 — same key, different basket
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{ayseToken}}
Idempotency-Key: checkout-demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 3 } ] }

### My orders (newest first, paged)
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{ayseToken}}

### Cancel an order (also allowed after it was confirmed; reserved stock is returned in the background)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{ayseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Vazgectim" }
